#### 🟡 MEDIUM SEVERITY

**5. Eager Test** — `OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds` (line 52)

```csharp
processor.ValidateOrder(order);
processor.CalculateTotal(order);
processor.ApplyDiscount(order, "SAVE10");
processor.ReserveInventory(order);
processor.ProcessPayment(order, new CreditCard("4111111111111111"));
processor.SendConfirmation(order);
processor.UpdateOrderHistory(order);
```

**Risk:** 7 distinct production methods — failure is impossible to diagnose without a debugger.
**Fix:** One test per behavior. If a full-workflow test is needed, mark it as integration and name it accordingly.

